content.text:
I have the data from the v3 positions endpoint. The response shows:

```json
{
  "vessel_id": "mv-rotterdam-77",
  "positions": [
    {"ts": "2024-06-01T03:00:00Z", "lat": 51.9244, "lon": 4.4777, "sog_knots": 12.4},
    {"ts": "2024-06-01T03:10:00Z", "lat": 51.9301, "lon": 4.4512, "sog_knots": 11.8}
  ],
  "track_ref": "trk-9f3a-4410"
}
```

The v3 endpoint returned 2 position fixes with full `sog_knots` fidelity. The maximum speed over ground is 12.4 knots.

```json
{
  "fix_count": 2,
  "max_sog_knots": 12.4
}
```
